Subject: [PATCH 084/220] [ae-patch] Show session names, never ids, in the
 split view's pane pickers

A pane holding a session outside the first page of the session list (archived, older, shared, just created) showed its raw id in the pane picker. Such a pane now fetches its own row, and every picker label goes through aeSplitPaneName: list title, fetched title, the frame's document title, Loading..., then Untitled session, with the legacy status glyph dropped and archived sessions marked.
